{"id":"MOEX-113020-1301-Q034","title":"十二指腸右移並次發後腹膜化，來源跨前腸與中腸","version":"accepted","batch":"113-1-med1","sourceSha256":"9fe23dee179590797431ae00e753228eb99a34d6389b8dcf2ddfa85115d5d7f4","sourceLibraryId":"libfile_bcf1a2ae00f881918c75b83e54cc2213","sourceAnchor":"q34","shortHtml":"<p>最適當的是 <strong>C</strong>。隨著胃與相關腸管的旋轉、生長，十二指腸移向右側並形成彎曲，之後大部分與後腹壁貼合，成為<strong>次發性後腹膜器官</strong>。</p>","html":"<div><h2>十二指腸右移並次發後腹膜化，來源跨前腸與中腸</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\">官方最終採計：C</p><p>最適當的是 <strong>C</strong>。隨著胃與相關腸管的旋轉、生長，十二指腸移向右側並形成彎曲，之後大部分與後腹壁貼合，成為<strong>次發性後腹膜器官</strong>。</p>\n<h3>先有腸管，再因位置改變而貼到後腹壁</h3>\n<p>早期腸管經腸繫膜懸吊，並非一開始就固定在成人看到的位置。胃的旋轉與周邊器官的生長帶動十二指腸向右移，其背側腸繫膜與後腹壁相關腹膜逐漸融合，使多數十二指腸失去原本可自由移動的繫膜關係。</p>\n<p>「次發性」描述的就是<strong>原本具有腸繫膜關係，後來才融合固定</strong>的過程。近幽門的起始短段仍較具活動性，因此題幹用「大部分貼在後腹壁」是恰當的限定。</p>\n<h3>先看胃的旋轉，再追十二指腸向右定位</h3><div class=\"reviewed-figure-group\"><figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1790px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.5565217391304347\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/0b695c7fc731cc186a9d86422196b23554df7d947004cdb0fb77a9c0693a990c.png\" alt=\"胃旋轉前：胃與背側胃繫膜仍居矢狀位\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1790\" height=\"1150\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/0b695c7fc731cc186a9d86422196b23554df7d947004cdb0fb77a9c0693a990c.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>旋轉前的橫斷示意：胃在中線，背側胃繫膜連向後腹壁。 圖：George S. Huntington（1903），<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Public domain（美國1903年出版原書；作者1927年逝世）</a>；<a href=\"https://archive.org/details/anatomyofhumanpe00huntrich/page/n182/mode/1up\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原圖來源</a>。</figcaption></figure><figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1590px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.6914893617021276\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/edc76a10641fe224b71f901b23357abbb0fe408a414b888c46374749f3ad3460.png\" alt=\"胃旋轉後：背側胃繫膜轉向左側\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1590\" height=\"940\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/edc76a10641fe224b71f901b23357abbb0fe408a414b888c46374749f3ad3460.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>旋轉後早期：胃改變朝向，背側胃繫膜彎向一側，胃後方形成新的腔隙關係。 圖：George S. Huntington（1903），<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Public domain（美國1903年出版原書；作者1927年逝世）</a>；<a href=\"https://archive.org/details/anatomyofhumanpe00huntrich/page/n183/mode/1up\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原圖來源</a>。</figcaption></figure></div><p>把兩張橫斷面中的<strong>胃（stomach）</strong>先對上：原先前後向的輪廓，旋轉後改成斜橫向；原本較直的<strong>背側胃繫膜（dorsal mesogastrium）</strong>也隨之偏移。後方的主動脈與脊椎是固定參照。這組前後狀態說明，腸管周邊的繫膜會隨旋轉重新排列。</p><figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1320px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.0476190476190477\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/8afb9f8765fc75fa78eacaa48cf8863169a34a9e700b10b986f5bbefd2cbacf1.png\" alt=\"胃旋轉後的前視圖：十二指腸位於身體右側\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1320\" height=\"1260\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/8afb9f8765fc75fa78eacaa48cf8863169a34a9e700b10b986f5bbefd2cbacf1.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>旋轉後的前視圖：胃右端接向十二指腸，mesoduodenum標示其背側繫膜。 圖：George S. Huntington（1903），<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Public domain（美國1903年出版原書；作者1927年逝世）</a>；<a href=\"https://archive.org/details/anatomyofhumanpe00huntrich/page/n184/mode/1up\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原圖來源</a>。</figcaption></figure><p>前視圖中，<strong>圖左對應身體右側</strong>。沿胃右端向圖左下追到彎曲的十二指腸，並找到<strong>mesoduodenum（十二指腸繫膜）</strong>；這是向右移位後的定位。把位置改變接到下方的融合前後圖，才形成完整順序：<strong>旋轉與右移 → 靠近後腹壁 → 腹膜融合固定</strong>。</p>\n<h3>比較貼合前後，理解「次發性後腹膜」</h3><figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1400px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.0606060606060606\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/179bbd72f0488339cab9cc5d03847b244de862c6708568277620b246e8b699ad.png\" alt=\"十二指腸貼壁前：臟層與壁層腹膜仍分開\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1400\" height=\"1320\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/179bbd72f0488339cab9cc5d03847b244de862c6708568277620b246e8b699ad.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>貼合前的矢狀示意：圖左為後腹壁方向及腎臟，圖右為降部十二指腸；兩者表面的腹膜線仍分開。 圖：George S. Huntington（1903），<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Public domain（美國1903年出版原書；作者1927年逝世）</a>；<a href=\"https://archive.org/details/anatomyofhumanpe00huntrich/page/n140/mode/1up\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原圖來源</a>。</figcaption></figure><p>先在貼合前圖找到左側<strong>kidney（腎臟）</strong>與右側<strong>duodenum（十二指腸）</strong>。紅線代表腹膜，腸管背面的臟層腹膜尚未與後腹壁的壁層腹膜相貼。此圖呈現的是貼合前狀態，不是胃旋轉的完整動態。</p><figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1970px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.5038167938931297\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/33d114c4e7d7dfdbae0de50f8cb776b15489dacfb9648a8abb7e9bb5862ffc72.png\" alt=\"十二指腸貼壁後：背側漿膜與壁層腹膜融合\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1970\" height=\"1310\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/33d114c4e7d7dfdbae0de50f8cb776b15489dacfb9648a8abb7e9bb5862ffc72.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>貼合後：十二指腸背面的腹膜與後腹壁腹膜融合，原本兩條界線改成融合區；腸管前面仍朝向腹膜腔。 圖：George S. Huntington（1903），<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Public domain（美國1903年出版原書；作者1927年逝世）</a>；<a href=\"https://archive.org/details/anatomyofhumanpe00huntrich/page/n141/mode/1up\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原圖來源</a>。</figcaption></figure><p>貼合後圖左上方的<strong>adhesion（融合）</strong>引線，正指向十二指腸背側與後腹壁的接觸處。比較兩圖，就能把「原先懸吊、後來固定」落在實際的兩層腹膜上。右側橫結腸與其繫膜是原圖保留的空間參照；本題重點在<strong>多數十二指腸移到後腹壁並融合固定</strong>。</p>\n<h3>來源、供血與管腔變化，三個地方都藏著考點</h3>\n<div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>選項主題</th><th>正確發育概念</th><th>錯誤在哪裡</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>A 十二指腸來源</td><td>尾端前腸加上頭端中腸</td><td>不是前腸與後腸</td></tr>\n<tr><td>B 血液供應</td><td>腹腔幹系統與上腸繫膜動脈系統</td><td>不是上、下腸繫膜動脈的組合</td></tr>\n<tr><td>C 旋轉與位置</td><td>右移，多數次發貼附後腹壁</td><td>符合典型發育過程</td></tr>\n<tr><td>D 管腔狀態</td><td>上皮增生可使管腔暫時閉塞，之後再通</td><td>並非全程保持中空</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<h3>為何十二指腸同時接到兩套動脈？</h3>\n<p>十二指腸跨越前腸與中腸來源的交界，因此供血也對應腹腔幹與上腸繫膜動脈。這與前面胰十二指腸動脈弓一題正好相接：<strong>上胰十二指腸動脈經胃十二指腸動脈連到腹腔幹，下胰十二指腸動脈連到上腸繫膜動脈</strong>。成人的血管吻合，保留了發育分區的線索。</p>\n<h3>再通是「重新出現管腔」</h3>\n<p>十二指腸上皮增生後，管腔曾暫時變窄或閉塞，再經發育重塑恢復通暢。傳統胚胎學以再通障礙解釋部分狹窄或閉鎖問題；本題只需抓住發育過程<strong>不是始終中空</strong>，即可排除 D。</p>\n<details><summary>原題、答鍵與查核來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：113年第一次醫學（一）原題，第34題</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=S\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：初始標準答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=M\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：更正後答案（第3、43題一律給分）</a></li><li><a href=\"https://embryology.oit.duke.edu/GI/GI.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Duke Embryology: Gut Development</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.columbia.edu/itc/hs/medical/humandev/2004/Chapt18-Endoderm.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Columbia University: Endodermal Derivatives—The Gut and its Derivatives</a></li><li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/anatomyofhumanpe00huntrich/page/n140/mode/1up\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">十二指腸貼壁前：臟層與壁層腹膜仍分開（原圖與授權）</a></li><li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/anatomyofhumanpe00huntrich/page/n141/mode/1up\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">十二指腸貼壁後：背側漿膜與壁層腹膜融合（原圖與授權）</a></li><li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/anatomyofhumanpe00huntrich/page/n182/mode/1up\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">胃旋轉前：胃與背側胃繫膜仍居矢狀位（原圖與授權）</a></li><li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/anatomyofhumanpe00huntrich/page/n183/mode/1up\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">胃旋轉後：背側胃繫膜轉向左側（原圖與授權）</a></li><li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/anatomyofhumanpe00huntrich/page/n184/mode/1up\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">胃旋轉後的前視圖：十二指腸位於身體右側（原圖與授權）</a></li></ul></details></div>","imageCount":5,"sourceAnswer":"官方最終採計：C"}